This should now be fixed in devel version. The change/growth models are most likely to cause errors, but the errors are hopefully getting fewer here.

Also, I wonder what you are doing with these lines:

change1 ~NA*1
change1 ~~NA*change1

Why put "NA" in there?

Ed

